ND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">일반인을 대상으로 다양한 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">ODA </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">교육을 실시하고 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><!--StartFragment--></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">2017.5.12(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">)~5.13(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">토</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">양일간 경북대학교 글로벌플라자 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">201</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">호에서 붙임과 같이 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGR